Tradeoffs and Risks
•	Risks include hardware price fluctuation and finding customers for the product
•	Tradeoffs all concern physical hardware. If we go for more expensive hardware we can provide a better service but our upfront cost is much higher.
Recommendation
•	Companies or groups most likely to approve this technology are companies which are already involved in the automotive sector and can offer these reports as an additional product to the customers they already have.
